@startuml 02-Actor-Hit
' 1층 Actor — 타격 한 번의 흐름. 연출은 IBattleVfx 를 거쳐 Vfx(10층)로 간다.
title 1층 Actor — 시퀀스: 타격 한 번

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant "Attack\n(hitbox)" as A
participant "Combat\n(attacker)" as C
participant "Combat (victim)\n: IHittable" as V
participant "Physics\n(victim)" as P
participant "BattleVfxSink.Current\n: IBattleVfx" as S
participant "BattleVfx\n(10 Vfx)" as X

A -> C : Attack(victim, hitData)
C -> V : Hit(hitData, attacker)
V -> V : CombatStateRules.Next → 상태 전이
V -> P : AddImpulse(dir, force)\nAddLaunch(height)
V --> C : landed
C --> A : true
A -> S : Impact(ground, height, away, radius, style)
S -> X : BattleVfx.Impact(…)
note over S, X : Current가 비어 있으면 아무 일 없음

== 넉백 중 벽 접촉 ==
P -> V : 벽 접촉
V -> S : WallBounce(ground, height, normal, radius)
S -> X : BattleVfx.WallBounce(…)
@enduml
